rooms_desc ({"This is the lavish entry hall to Cara's house.A magic archway on the south wall leads back to the earthly worldand doors lead north, east and west.The room has a bright chandelier in the centreand is well lit. The marble and slate finish gives this rooma feeling of elegance.","This is a small ornate hallway. There are exits south, to the study, east, to the bedroom, and west, to the lounge.There are a line of chandeliers lighting this hall, at theend is a large window looking out on the Astryl Plains.The famed temple of Isnoss - council hall of the gods is seenin the distance. The river Styx flows silently beneath thefloor of this extravigant house.","This is Cara's bathroom, it is rather small, however highly ornate.There is a toilet and basin on the south wall, and a large 2 personshower on the north, a spa bath sits in a glass covet on the eastwall, and the dim light of the Astryl ring shines in to the room through the large crystal glass.The room is entirely crafted out of a large marble block, it has seemless wallsand floors, and finishings are gold.","This is a large and elegant room, it is furnishedin deep burgundy with gold triming. There is a largemirrored robe on the south wall, with a door to the bathroom.To the north is a large bay window, with satin drapes.The large comfortable bed sits in the middle of the east wall,the burgundy silk curtains drape its four posts.A sky light provides light or a view of the stars to this wonderful room.","This is Cara's elaborate studyIt is furnished in the finest limbe book casesand a large ornate oaken deak. A chandelier hangs low over the desk, and lights the room well.A small lounge sits against the wall.","This is an ornate lounge room with the finest furnitureimaginable. You could almost swear the gods made this room.The decorations are intricate and perfect to the last detailas if the materials grew just to form this furniture.A set of large lounge chairs and a small cabinet decoratethe room.","A large and well used kitchen - Cara likesto cook. The room is imaculate and tidy tho, and some of theappliances look like nothing you have ever seen before.You think they must be from distant lands or other worlds.","A large dining room. The table looks long enough to hold a feastand probably has had a few. The room is well lit with candleslined up down the table centre in a perfect line.The teak table and chairs are as ornate as the lounge furniture.","THE TEMPLE OF ISNOSSThe view from here is Magnificent, the whole world stretches out beneath it.","This is a small chamber. Statues of a Bird, a Cat, a Griffon and a large armour clad Knight stand silently before a small alter.A single candle burns at the alter.On the alter is a circle of strange symbols, as you look closely you notice the top symbol is that of Cara's family.And the symbols of Zeus, Nicademus and Awran are near it.",})
rooms_short ({"Entry hall","A hall in Cara's house.","A small and ornate bathroom","Cara's Bedroom","Cara's study.","Cara's Lounge","Cara's Kitchen","Dining Room","ISNOSS","A Chamber",})
